				<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-mapa-canvas-dark border border-mapa-contour/70 space-y-1.5 flex flex-col justify-between">
					<div>
						<div class="font-bold text-sm text-mapa-ink">National Historical Commission of the Philippines (NHCP)</div>
						<p>Historical Marker Register for Kilometer Zero Luneta (Manila), Banggolo Bridge (Marawi City), and Casa Real de Iloilo.</p>
						<p class="text-[11px] text-mapa-clay">Executive Order No. 45 & Bureau of Public Works Historical Archives (1913).</p>
					</div>
					<div class="pt-2 border-t border-mapa-contour/40">
						<a href="https://nhcp.gov.ph" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-mapa-green font-bold hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1">
