					<div>
						<div class="font-bold text-sm text-mapa-ink">Filipino-American Memorial Endowment (FAME)</div>
						<p>Official Survey Registry of the 138 Bataan Death March Memorial Markers from KM 00 Mariveles/Bagac to Camp O'Donnell, Capas, Tarlac.</p>
						<p class="text-[11px] text-mapa-clay">Battling Bastards of Bataan Foundation Historical Milepost Directory.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="pt-2 border-t border-mapa-contour/40">
						<a href="https://filipino-americanmemorials.org/bataan-death-march-markers/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-mapa-green font-bold hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1">
							<span>FAME Bataan Memorial Markers Registry</span>
							<span>&rarr;</span>
						</a>
