						<div class="font-bold text-sm text-mapa-ink">National Mapping and Resource Information Authority (NAMRIA)</div>
						<p>Topographic basemaps, geodetic leveling benchmarks, and road network coordinates.</p>
						<p class="text-[11px] text-mapa-clay">Philippine Reference System 1992 (PRS92) Geodetic Control Network.</p>
					</div>
